    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Allan Chekwech, Acting Managing Editor at Nation Media Group Uganda, is no stranger to the media industry. With years of experience under his belt, he was already an accomplished professional when he chose to embark on the Executive Master's in Media Leadership and Innovation (EMMLI) programme at Aga Khan University's Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC). Despite his success, Allan recognized the need for more: a programme that would provide a practical and forward-looking approach to leadership and innovation in the fast-evolving world of media.",
